    "title": "How To Watch The 'Laguna Beach Reunion': Start Time, Roku Streaming Info",
    "text": "Published April 9, 2026, 1:00 p.m. ET Nikki Glaser: Good Girl - Trailer0 seconds of 1 minute, 8 secondsVolume 0% The original cast of the iconic reality series Laguna Beach: The Real Orange County reunite in what’s sure to be a nostalgic trip down memory lane in this must-see reunion special! Airing from 2004 to 2006 on MTV, Laguna Beach was a true pop culture phenomenon. For the first time since the original series ended, Lauren Conrad, Stephen Colletti, Kristin Cavallari, and many more from the original cast are about to come together to commemorate the 20th anniversary of this beloved reality staple. Per the official press release, the reunion will feature “untold behind-the-scenes stories, cast reactions to episodes of the original series, and a present-day return to where it all started: Laguna Beach.” “Laguna Beach wasn’t just a television series; it defined a generation of pop culture and paved the way for the reality genre as we know it,” Head of Roku Originals Brian Tannenbaum said in a statement. “Reuniting this cast two decades later is a dream, and we are delighted to give streamers a front-row seat to the nostalgia.” If you want to rewatch some of the original episodes before the reunion, all three seasons are currently streaming on Paramount+. Cue Hilary Duff’s “Come Clean.“ From start time to streaming info, here’s where to watch the Laguna Beach Reunion online. What Channel Is The Laguna Beach Reunion On? Visit Advertiser websiteGO TO PAGEThe two-hour reunion special will be available to stream on Roku. What Time Does The Laguna Beach Reunion Start? The Laguna Beach Reunion premieres Friday, April 10 at 3:01 a.m. ET on Roku. Who Will Be At The Laguna Beach Reunion? As we mentioned above, Lauren Conrad, Stephen Colletti, and Kristin Cavallari are returning for the reunion. The trio will be joined by Lo Bosworth, Talan Torriero, Trey Phillips, Christina Shuller, Dieter Schmitz, Jessica Smith, and Alex Hooser. How To Watch The Laguna Beach Reunion on Roku: The Laguna Beach Reunion will be available to stream for free on all Roku devices or TVs. You can also watch the special on the Roku website as well as iOS and Android devices, Amazon Fire TVs, Samsung TVs, Google TVs, and other Android TV OS devices. Where To Watch The Original Laguna Beach: All three seasons of Laguna Beach are currently streaming on Paramount+. The Laguna Beach Reunion premieres Friday, April 10 at 3:01 a.m. ET on Roku. Tags Laguna Beach: The Real Orange County Stephen Colletti The Roku Channel",
